Add the requireBaseSnapshotForDelta parameter of the snapshot volume policy action, for storages such as Ceph RBD that need the base volume snapshot kept for incremental backups by the block data mover. Velero records the retained snapshot on the DataUpload when it completes, requests the deletion of the parent's snapshot once the next backup has retained its own, and requests the deletion of a backup's retained snapshot when the backup is deleted. The parameter names of the snapshot action are validated against a closed list (dataMover, snapshotClass, requireBaseSnapshotForDelta), so a typo fails validation instead of silently reading as false.
